# The plugin maintainers review everything in the ashby plugin. The contract maintainers review package.json, AGENTS.md
# and docs/, because those carry the manifest, the contract and the standard.

*                         @we-the-rebel-alliance/plugin-maintainers
/package.json             @we-the-rebel-alliance/contract-maintainers
/AGENTS.md                @we-the-rebel-alliance/contract-maintainers
/docs/                    @we-the-rebel-alliance/contract-maintainers
